# Durable-arm event logs from a SWE-bench sweep: one fsynced log per instance,
# written while the sweep runs. The predictions file and its .runlog.jsonl are
# the artifacts worth committing; these are the raw post-mortem record, and
# committing them mid-sweep captures a half-written log.
